      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "•Coonan Property present this substantial four-bedroom family home with integrated garage, ideally positioned within the mature and highly sought-after Castletown development\n•Extending to approximately 160 sq.m., the property offers generous, well-proportioned accommodation with excellent potential for refurbishment and modernisation\n•Accommodation briefly comprises entrance porch and hallway, living room, open-plan kitchen/dining area, sunroom, ground-floor w.c., utility with shower area, three bedrooms, first-floor study and main bathroom\n•Spacious rooms and a flexible layout offer superb scope to reconfigure and create a contemporary family home, while the integrated garage provides further potential for conversion, subject to planning\n•Ideally positioned in a quiet cul-de-sac adjacent to a large green area, making it particularly appealing for families\n•Established residential location within walking distance of primary and secondary schools, sports clubs, Aldi, Lidl, Eurospar and Leixlip village\n•Excellent transport links with Louisa Bridge train station, bus services and convenient access to the M4, M50 and Dublin City\n•A rare opportunity to acquire a substantial home with the space, setting and potential to create an exceptional modern family residence\n\nGuide Price\n495,000\n\nType of Transaction\nPrivate Treaty\n\nAccommodation:\n\nEntrance Driveway\nCobble lock and paved driveway and raised flowerbeds. Off street parking for 2-3 cars \n\nPorch \nTiled flooring, light fitting and French doors. \n\nEntrance Hallway (Including Porch) 2.2m x 5.4m\nTiled flooring, light fitting, wallpaper walls, coving, additional storage space with shelves and fitted mirror. \n\nGuest W.C. 1.1m x 1.4m\nFully tiled, wood panel ceiling, light fitting, w.c., w.h.b., fitted mirror, window and curtain. \n\nLiving Room 3.9m x 4.5m \nCarpet flooring, hanging pendant light, fitted wall lamps, wallpapered walls, coving, gas fireplace with stone hearth and surround with integrated shelves and dimmable light switch. \n \nKitchen/Dining Area 6.2m x 4m\nTiled flooring, fitted spotlights, curtains, floor to wall kitchen cabinets, stainless steel sink, integrated double oven, freestanding fridge/freezer, integrated dishwasher, Neff hob, extractor fan and fitted wall lamps.\n \nSunroom 5.3m x 3.2m \nLaminate flooring, two Velux windows, solid fuel stove with granite hearth and wooden surround, curtains, fitted wall lamps and door leading to rear garden. \n\nUtility/Shower Room (Including Guest W.C.) 2.9m x 2.3m\nTiled flooring, light fitting, shower cubicle with Mira shower system, fully plumbed with washing machine, shelves, door leading to rear garden and access to garage. \n\nGarage (3.7m x 5.5m) + (1.1m x 3m)\nShelving, steel roller shutter door , light fitting, additional sockets and door leading to rear garden. \n\nLanding 3m x 1m, 1.8m x 0.9m\nCarpet flooring from stairway to landing, wallpapered walls, recessed lights, hot press with shelving, access to attic space via fitted folding ladder and light fitting in attic space. \n\nMaster Bedroom (Front) 4.3m x 3.1m\nLaminate flooring, light fitting and curtains. \n\nBedroom 2 (Rear) 4m x 3.1m\nLaminate flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, curtains and fitted wardrobe. \n \nBedroom 3 (Front) 3.2m x 3m\nLaminate flooring, hanging pendant light with shade, curtains, wallpapered walls and fitted wardrobes. \n\nStudy Room 2.1m x 1.7m \nOriginally the main bathroom\nCarpet flooring, light fitting, curtains, w.h.b. with fitted vanity unit and mirror. \n\nFamily Bathroom 2.9m x 2.3m\nOriginally the 4th bedroom. \nFully tiled, recessed lights, w.c., w.h.b. with fitted mirror and shaving light, heated vertical towel rail, shower cubicle with monshoon shower head, bath with Mira shower system, roiller blinds, curtains and window. \n\nGarden (6.7m x 10.1m) + (5.2m x 6.6m)\nNorth/West facing, concrete paved patio, raised flower beds, yellow granite steps, mature trees and hedging surround, outdoor tap, wired for outdoor light, granite garden bench and table. \n\nAdditional Information:\nGross internal floor area approx. 160 sq.m \nBuilt c. 1970`s\nPVC fascias and soffits surround \nWater pump system \n\nItems Included in sale:\nAll curtains, blinds, light fittings and shades, oven, hob, free standing fridge/freezer, extractor fan, dishwasher, washing machine, garden table and bench.\n\nServices\nMains water \nOil fired central heating \n\nBER \nE\n\nViewing\nBy appointment only.\n\nEircode: W23 C9T1\n\nContact Information\nSales Person \nMick Wright\n01 628 6128\n\n\n \n"
